    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "narrator",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "sourceStart": 0,
        "sourceEnd": 173,
        "text": "[Meeting room, Riverside Community Clinic. Present: Dr. Maya Chen (facilitator), Tom Baker (senior nurse), Priya Shah (quality lead), and Ben Okafor (junior administrator).]",
        "boundary": "paragraph",
        "voice": "en-US-BrianNeural",
        "textHash": "fd3d7db6ef92a84bee1fca6470c608392676e2ba3a8ba8cc62c9d6076bd74451",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 181,
        "sourceEnd": 370,
        "text": "Thanks for coming. Today we’re reviewing the medication-error incident from last month. The goal is to understand what happened and what we can change. Tom, can you start with the timeline?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "3fdc18bf3b154c64958e94e7290aaa21eb4eda9e5e4b43b02e4da4138ef5e6fc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 377,
        "sourceEnd": 579,
        "text": "Sure. On the 14th, a patient was given the wrong dose of a blood thinner. The nurse on duty was experienced, but the shift was short-staffed. The error was caught two hours later during a routine check.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "e26c307c3990eea14fb5bf6f93ba6e5552c841887b49fd196b88ed03d739d123",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 588,
        "sourceEnd": 630,
        "text": "Sorry to interrupt—was the patient harmed?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1ac4a0e67ef0d1397ec404bf4be25092c8a3fb6ae21bc7cce7a7b1bb9ff525b4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 637,
        "sourceEnd": 722,
        "text": "No, thankfully. The patient was monitored and was fine. But we need to learn from it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "614033b4a5ba77d9281f258fc35eb5da0ad76c850a540c18682de274a6e203cc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 730,
        "sourceEnd": 792,
        "text": "Right. Ben, you looked at the incident report. What stood out?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7ad60560d5b17519cb690dbbdfa8e6d87aed6013aeb3eea04caa5178a9b274f2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 799,
        "sourceEnd": 989,
        "text": "The report was filed three days late. That’s a problem because details get forgotten. Also, the form asks for the nurse’s name, but not for the system factors—like workload or interruptions.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "3600eb47a5c5bc9cb00bddbcc94a073428e224c5ed353862bda72c43573244a4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 998,
        "sourceEnd": 1153,
        "text": "That’s a key point. If we only blame the individual, we miss the bigger picture. I’d suggest we revise the form to include a section on working conditions.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "64006302294cfe214b4e17007994efd8adc612642d48280f0921fcaebe5f2d4f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1161,
        "sourceEnd": 1196,
        "text": "Good. Tom, what about the training?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "45b8bb0fda77befd7b1533ab6cd845f87f28127ab56020b5f083d8f9abfc7fda",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1203,
        "sourceEnd": 1362,
        "text": "The nurse had completed the online module, but it was six months old. The module doesn’t cover new drug names. So maybe we need shorter, more frequent updates.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "99d264795e615dfd54383b6bc80a87670844c5c885c85eb7761a90e2cd513d6e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1369,
        "sourceEnd": 1465,
        "text": "I agree. And we could add a quick team huddle before each shift to review high-risk medications.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "ea2c4acc860063f7cb88848f2095ff6f687bbf724db78d99e0d92938c5fa9477",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1473,
        "sourceEnd": 1596,
        "text": "Let’s note that. Priya, you mentioned earlier that other clinics have tried a “no-blame” reporting system. Can you explain?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "347e748e6d806621d5f42b3a957ca3667c8542515dcc436f7bc79ea210eb08be",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 1605,
        "sourceEnd": 1802,
        "text": "Yes. In a no-blame system, staff report errors without fear of punishment. The focus is on learning, not on blaming. But it only works if leadership supports it and if reports are acted on quickly.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "b46fe6afbb18ea9ab0a88bc69b294047a82a29d761a3abc14ca44239c36fede2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1810,
        "sourceEnd": 1906,
        "text": "So we need both a culture change and a process change. Tom, how did staff react to the incident?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7e331f62a63b2c484cc53a20d57494dff980f3550aab1de03313a632ea1ec005",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1913,
        "sourceEnd": 2103,
        "text": "Some were anxious. A few worried they’d be punished. But after the manager explained the no-blame approach, people became more open. One nurse said she now feels safer reporting near-misses.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "808b5b07510af8b2becfcf9bd4ad37ce416968a225ca32b8f2c116b578e8e6fd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2111,
        "sourceEnd": 2172,
        "text": "That’s encouraging. Ben, can you summarize the action points?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "79f6dc7de7b97e6e4bb9bd4b845af5e06bcf8415db1bdde41df4ebfb125eb1e2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 2179,
        "sourceEnd": 2408,
        "text": "Sure. First, revise the incident form to include system factors. Second, introduce short monthly training updates. Third, pilot a pre-shift huddle for high-risk drugs. Fourth, communicate the no-blame policy clearly to all staff.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a178f22cb11073b8aca2a18a48fbf428d6533d9b7179ad2bd0ded494e8c27a2d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2416,
        "sourceEnd": 2446,
        "text": "And who will lead each action?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "db73a86d6f4dd8879903d2c45fec80733aeb21d1ff51fd82860dfc0229a0ea51",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 2453,
        "sourceEnd": 2580,
        "text": "I can lead the form revision with Priya. Tom can lead the training updates. And the huddle pilot—maybe Priya and I can co-lead.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "feeb0097f25fb4c7057c76a8ce92fa2b69175a8c2abebec04b42ab52a819fd2b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 2589,
        "sourceEnd": 2673,
        "text": "That works for me. But we need a timeline. Can we aim to start the pilot next month?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "48fc2ca9b8448fabf3e5d7b84f6f3b4a5b967618de6c8a96e09a798655763455",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2681,
        "sourceEnd": 2764,
        "text": "Yes, let’s set a review meeting in six weeks to check progress. Any other comments?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "cec5757652a14d7caebaa8d33fcc983300e4dba2daa89b73a496485ab4b6e13f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 2771,
        "sourceEnd": 2867,
        "text": "Just one. We should also share the learning with the wider network. Other clinics might benefit.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "ade0355428088036253b9dac4c2d8b85cedd94248795b2a2c266b260ad2df6ce",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 2875,
        "sourceEnd": 3025,
        "text": "Agreed. I’ll draft a short summary for the regional meeting. Thanks, everyone. Let’s make sure this becomes a learning opportunity, not just a report.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "3ea7e6c336c9a8798a6ec490a9111aaf2d82c2b3cbc95e2e1c8f767d64251968",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
